/**
 * P1453: the artist pool for profile banners. Picked by era, then artist (artist-banner.ts).
 *
 * Drafted by an LLM and checked for duplicates and counts. The FOUNDER REVIEW of names, dates,
 * works and `exclude` flags is an acceptance criterion of P1453 and is recorded in the spec.
 * Set `exclude: true` to keep an entry in the file but never draw it.
 *
 * `sig` is the credit line ("after <sig>"), not the legal name. It must stay inside the Latin
 * subset of the self-hosted Caveat font; src/tests/p1453-artist-picker.test.ts enforces that.
 * Plain data only, no imports: the edge functions and vitest both load this file.
 */

